values ('bbbb0006-0000-4000-8000-000000000006', 'en', null, 'Dance: History & Appreciation', 'A guided tour through the art of dance - what it is, where it came from, and how to watch it with an informed eye - moving from ritual and folk traditions to ballet, modern dance, social and popular dance, Broadway, and hip-hop. The structure and facts are adapted from the Dance article on Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia (CC BY-SA 4.0). No prior training is assumed; you only need curiosity and a willingness to look closely.', null, 'foundations', 65, true, 'arts', '{}')
on conflict (id) do nothing;

